          "short": "$$\\begin{array}{r|lllllllllll}7&6&6&7&8&9\\\\8&1&2&2&4&4&5&6&6&6&7&9\\\\9&1&1&3&3&4&4&4&5&6&6&7\\\\10&2&4&6\\end{array}$$\n\nKey: $8\\mid1$ means $81\\text{ kg}$.",
          "worked": "Use the tens as stems and the units as leaves; weights from 100 to 109 have stem 10. Order the leaves on each stem.\n\n$$\\begin{array}{r|lllllllllll}7&6&6&7&8&9\\\\8&1&2&2&4&4&5&6&6&6&7&9\\\\9&1&1&3&3&4&4&4&5&6&6&7\\\\10&2&4&6\\end{array}$$\n\nKey: $8\\mid1$ means $81\\text{ kg}$. There are $5+11+11+3=30$ leaves.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
      },
      {
